Megapropodiphora Arnoldi Neutrino.

Ingredients.
77 g blue_shrimp
101 g salt
103 g maggots
97 g lentil
112 g isopods
114 g copper_sulfate
111 g menthol
112 g blueberries
111 g liquid_xenon
100 g liquid_helium
105 g phorid_fly_pupa
112 g electron_neutrino
104 g muon_neutrino
111 g tau_neutrino
114 g phorid_fly_egg
97 g pure_phorid_fly
32 g salted_phorid_fly
97 g smashed_phorid_fly
114 g euryplatea_nanaknihali
110 g megapropodiphora_arnoldi
111 g euryplatea_eidmanni
108 g head_of_ant
100 g pseudacteon_tricuspis
105 g pseudacteon_curvatus
32 g pseudacteon_litoralis
110 g pseudacteon_obtusus
101 g pseudacteon_wasmanni
117 g pseudacteon_bifidus
116 g apocephalus_paraponerae
114 g pseudacteon_formicarum
105 g pseudacteon_crawfordi
110 g pseudacteon_nocens
111 g apocephalus_coquilletti

Method.
Put apocephalus_coquilletti into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_nocens into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_crawfordi into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_formicarum into mixing bowl.
Put apocephalus_paraponerae into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_bifidus into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_wasmanni into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_obtusus into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_litoralis into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_curvatus into mixing bowl.
Put pseudacteon_tricuspis into mixing bowl.
Put head_of_ant into mixing bowl.
Put euryplatea_eidmanni into mixing bowl.
Put megapropodiphora_arnoldi into mixing bowl.
Put euryplatea_nanaknihali into mixing bowl.
Put smashed_phorid_fly into mixing bowl.
Put salted_phorid_fly into mixing bowl.
Put pure_phorid_fly into mixing bowl.
Put phorid_fly_egg into mixing bowl.
Put tau_neutrino into mixing bowl.
Put muon_neutrino into mixing bowl.
Put electron_neutrino into mixing bowl.
Put phorid_fly_pupa into mixing bowl.
Put liquid_helium into mixing bowl.
Put liquid_xenon into mixing bowl.
Put blueberries into mixing bowl.
Put menthol into mixing bowl.
Put copper_sulfate into mixing bowl.
Put isopods into mixing bowl.
Put lentil into mixing bowl.
Put maggots into mixing bowl.
Put salt into mixing bowl.
Put blue_shrimp into mixing bowl.
Pour contents of mixing bowl into baking dish.

Serves 1.
